{% doc %}
  Kinetik shared RTE (rich text) output wrapper. Renders Liquid-generated HTML
  (article.content, page.content, product.description, collection.description) through
  one consistent style pass for p, a, h1-h6, blockquote, ul/ol, li, and img, per the
  Theme Store requirement that RTE styling match across blog articles, product
  descriptions, and collection descriptions.
  @param {string} content - RTE HTML, e.g. article.content / page.content / product.description / collection.description
  @param {string} [class] - extra wrapper classes for this call site's typography/spacing context (e.g. text-body-lg, max-w-prose, mt-10, text-text-muted)
{% enddoc %}
